---
id: flat-white
title: Flat White
category: breakfast

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 92

storage:
  fridge_days: 1
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Pour @partly-skimmed-milk-2pct{1/4%cup} into a small mug and warm in the #microwave until hot and steaming, without boiling.

Grind whole beans with a #coffee-bean-grinder and pull a single shot of @lavazza-super-crema{1%shot} with an #espresso-machine over the warm milk, then stir.
